card.statement:
For $\alpha\in\mb F,\,A,U_1,\dots,U_k\in\mf g\otimes\mc V$, with $k\geq1$, we have

\begin{equation}
\begin{array}{l}
\displaystyle{
\frac{\partial}{\partial u_i^{(m)}} \Big(\ad(U_1)\cdots\ad(U_k)(\alpha\partial+A)\Big)
} \\
\displaystyle{
=
\sum_{h=1}^k\ad(U_1)\cdots\ad\Big(\frac{\partial U_h}{\partial u_i^{(m)}}\Big)\cdots\ad(U_k)(\alpha\partial+A)
} \\
\displaystyle{
+\ad(U_1)\cdots\ad(U_k)\Big(\frac{\partial A}{\partial u_i^{(m)}}\Big)
-\alpha\ad(U_1)\cdots\ad(U_{k-1})\Big(\frac{\partial U_k}{\partial u_i^{(m-1)}}\Big)\,.
}
\end{array}
\end{equation}
